    "evidence": "The “Your turn, Red.” framing, cyan/red adversarial palette, and side-by-side ALLOW/BLOCK reveal create a coherent demo narrative across viewports. However, most of the visual language remains familiar dark-dashboard UI: sliders, badges, progress bars, bordered cards, and monospace labels. The screen lacks one unmistakable visual artifact that viewers would remember afterward.",
